1 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535482 true] [17592186351491 1041 "selection" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351491 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351496 13194139535482 true] [17592186351491 1110 #uuid "e7da6c48-1331-5c88-aa9c-b1f1b75b015a" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351492 1034 "10x-5" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351492 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351492 1111 #uuid "cf4886af-f97a-5049-84c9-37eeae59bad4" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351493 1034 "-6x+6" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351493 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351493 1111 #uuid "360d4066-e900-5647-acdd-b60e7b23c568" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351494 1034 "-10x+8" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351494 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351494 1111 #uuid "fc56fbd3-6dff-527b-bfd7-cf26c61b6c27" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351495 1034 "2x-5" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351495 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351495 1111 #uuid "35ae1c9f-351b-5677-9db0-427a7301954e" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351496 1034 "-12x-10" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351496 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351496 1111 #uuid "fe48562f-1da1-53c7-ad5d-f4b80e0baaaa" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351498 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351500 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1089 "q-322924" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1100 "Express $\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ | __ |  |  | $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ |" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1113 #uuid "9285cb79-17c7-50c5-8156-d768562b3668" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351497 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+x-5 \\\\  & 4{x}^{2}-3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{4}+6{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-23{x}^{2}+24x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,20{x}^{2}+22x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+15x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-2{x}^{2}+x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+6.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2} & =-2{x}^{2}+x-5+\\frac{7x+6}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351499 13194139535482 true] [17592186351498 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535482 true] [17592186351498 1041 "field-1" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351498 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351499 13194139535482 true] [17592186351498 1110 #uuid "96125f21-a19b-51f6-868c-e614a9df64ca" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351499 1034 "-2x^2+x-5" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351499 1111 #uuid "0fa227dc-68a1-5f2c-a513-1ae35c1388ab" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351501 13194139535482 true] [17592186351500 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535482 true] [17592186351500 1041 "field-2" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351500 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351501 13194139535482 true] [17592186351500 1110 #uuid "56eed73e-ff28-5c57-a694-c3748ebb6f4d" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351501 1034 "7x+6" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351501 1111 #uuid "da3d15bb-67b6-5406-a377-9a5a9774edad" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351503 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1089 "q-325106" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1100 "What is the quotient of $-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3$ divided by $-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1113 #uuid "12438b1b-50e6-5f18-b2e4-ecce962c3001" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351502 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-3 \\\\  & -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{4}+8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-13{x}^{2}+x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-5x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}-5x+6.$" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351504 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351505 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1041 "field-1" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351505 13194139535482 true] [17592186351503 1110 #uuid "6ff9760f-96e1-5baf-8aa1-c733cb08b5d9" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351504 1034 "2x+3" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351504 1111 #uuid "82ce60c2-2106-5c9f-8f5c-a930eb40c785" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351505 1034 "2x-3" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351505 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351505 1111 #uuid "02b57776-02ac-59e6-bbab-8d7bb5b4473b" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351507 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1089 "q-325143" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1100 "What is the remainder of $-4{x}^{3}+16$ divided by $2{x}^{2}-3x+5?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1113 #uuid "5f489c11-d556-5f9b-8cf2-027cb23be58e" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351506 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n-4{x}^{3}+16=-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+16\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-3 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+6\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6{x}^{2}+10x+16 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}+9x-15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+31\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+31.$" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351507 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351508 13194139535482 true] [17592186351507 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535482 true] [17592186351507 1041 "field-1" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351507 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351508 13194139535482 true] [17592186351507 1110 #uuid "8458d67b-1ddb-516b-b1c7-aca7b0e320a8" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351508 1034 "x+31" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351508 1111 #uuid "f20edbd6-fa52-5062-acfc-afcbe7a018aa" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351510 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1089 "q-37972" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1100 "What is the quotient of $3{x}^{3}-8$ divided by ${x}^{2}-1?$" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1113 #uuid "d827abae-dd9f-5627-9629-e5ca430ed96f" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351509 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n3{x}^{3}-8=3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-8.$" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351511 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351512 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351513 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351514 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351515 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1041 "selection" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351511 13194139535482 true] [17592186351510 1110 #uuid "b678a0d9-922a-5837-9f34-3a9b11ffdca9" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351511 1034 "3x" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351511 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351511 1111 #uuid "601f09c4-7e32-58ff-b170-cf167ef46577" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351512 1034 "-8" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351512 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351512 1111 #uuid "59e4c9cb-3ffa-5ed6-ba7a-6d4a202a403f" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351513 1034 "5x-1" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351513 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351513 1111 #uuid "6a3e8a97-595e-5ba0-a712-c905235acb7a" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351514 1034 "-2x+3" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351514 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535482 true] [17592186351514 1111 #uuid "f141d559-d95e-5b68-8d14-30b92431626d" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351515 1034 "4" 13194139535482 true] [17592186351515 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1